{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"agent_message","text":"The ReadIndex finding is now confirmed within its recorded scope. A separate session-recovery suspicion appears explained: successful session saves visit entries from least to most recently used, restoring the same eviction order, and production snapshot metadata uses an in-memory buffer. I’ll retain that explanation and move on to authority and membership boundaries."}}
